<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Senate approves bill to open energy sector.</title>
<headline>Brazil Senate approves bill to open energy sector.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Senate on Wednesday approved a bill that would open up the country's oil and gas sectors to private competition, an official said.</p>
<p>The bill, which spells out regulations related to a 1995 constitutional amendment that scraps the state's petroleum monopoly, was approved by a 58-to-16 vote in the upper house.</p>
